DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260720T170000
DTSTAMP:20260703T223108Z
UID:smcl-6a31b20a72ddb736008171d7@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Today\, we'll be scientists\, engineers and beyond! Join us at
  the library every month for a new STEAM activity for you to explore. This
  time\, we’ll be creating our own unique soap sculpture using a bar of s
 oap and upcycled carving tools! No registration\, as supplies last.\n\nAge
 s: 6-11\nRegistration: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/ev
 ents/6a31b20a72ddb736008171d7\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:31 PDT
