BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] The Magic Book
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T110000
DTSTAMP:20260703T223108Z
UID:smcl-69fb6f41f6bd012f00662005@local-events
DESCRIPTION:The Magic Book is an interactive performance about wonder\, pl
 ayfulness & the power of learning. This family-friendly show blends magic\
 , storytelling\, and circus arts to share the joy of reading\, foreign lan
