DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T170000
DTSTAMP:20260703T223108Z
UID:smcl-6a481d8af47779f28bbe1a5b@local-events
DESCRIPTION:The Library Green Team is a collaborative Earth-forward progra
 m aiming to build enthusiasm for taking care of our planet and appreciatin
 g nature. Participants will engage in exciting\, eco-friendly\, nature-rel
 ated crafts\, games\, and activities while learning more about their role 
 as upcoming planet protectors. \n\nThis week\, join us outside in the Chil
 dren’s Garden for an outdoor scavenger hunt! Find all the hidden critter
 s in our garden to earn your Library Green Team badge!\n\nAges: 6-11\nRegi
 stration: none\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a481d8af477
 79f28bbe1a5b\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:31 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a481d8af47779f28bbe1a5b
END:VEVENT
