BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[SC] The Great Library Book Adventure With Ricky Roo & Friends
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260728T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260728T154500
DTSTAMP:20260703T223108Z
UID:smcl-6a21b788c7d3cd58005e1234@local-events
DESCRIPTION:When the mischievous pirate Captain Bluebeard sneaks into the 
 library and steals a book to take back to his island\, the whole library i
 s in trouble! Luckily\, a brave child from the audience steps up to the ch
 allenge. Together with Ricky Roo and his puppet friends\, they set off on 
 a silly adventure to get the book back and teach the pirate an important l
 esson: library books are meant to be shared—checked out\, enjoyed\, and 
 returned—for the whole community.\n \nA laugh-out-loud puppet show fille
 d with jokes\, audience participation\, and a heartwarming message about b
 ooks\, libraries\, and community. Perfect for young readers and future lib
 rary lovers!\n\nAges: 0-5\, 6-11\nRegistration: none\nSource: https://smcl
 .bibliocommons.com/events/6a21b788c7d3cd58005e1234\nLast synced: 2026-07-0
 3 15:31 PDT
LOCATION:San Carlos
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a21b788c7d3cd58005e1234
END:VEVENT
