UID:smcl-6a2b3e2616554cd59fc82fbd@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Let’s get messy this summer! Join us for a fun new experimen
 t that will explore the exciting and reactive sides of science. This week\
 , we’ll be we’ll be mixing our own soap solution that we can use to cr
 eate our own homemade bubbles!\n\n\nAprons will be available upon request 
 for anyone looking to mitigate the mess. No registration required\, as su
 pplies last.\n\nAges: 6-11\nRegistration: none\nSource: https://smcl.bibli
 ocommons.com/events/6a2b3e2616554cd59fc82fbd\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:3
 1 PDT
