SUMMARY:[ATH] World of Reptiles
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260716T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260716T170000
DTSTAMP:20260703T223108Z
UID:smcl-69e7fcdec1cf6f9a7586e447@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us together with John Hale\, the “Reptile Guy\,” for 
 a chance to meet\, talk about\, and pet or hold tortoises\, lizards and sn
 akes! John is a long-term rescuer of reptiles and presenter in schools thr
 oughout the Peninsula. Stop by the library to meet his assorted and colorf
 ul reptile “cast of characters” for a fun and spirited learning experi
 ence!\n\nThis event will include two 30-minute shows (starting at 4pm and 
 4:30pm)\, with a capacity of up to 30 people per showing.\n\nAges: 6-11\n
