DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260905T113000
DTSTAMP:20260703T223108Z
UID:smcl-6a399e979571053ed63c0b52@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to learn and play with your little one! Hear new sto
 ries\, sing songs\, and learn wiggles that the whole family can enjoy toge
 ther\, from toddlers to grown-ups.\n\nThis event will be held in the child
 ren's room at the Atherton Library. Storytime will be held for the first 3
 0 minutes of the hour. After Storytime\, join us for Stay and Play\, wher
 e kids and their caregivers can practice interpersonal skills and have fun
  learning to share and socialize!\n\nAges: 0-5\, 6-11\nRegistration: none\
 nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a399e979571053ed63c0b52\nL
 ast synced: 2026-07-03 15:31 PDT
