 ect for little hands! Every second Monday of the month\, we’ll have a ne
 w experiment in the arts and science that you and your little one can expl
 ore together. This month\, bring your favorite (or second favorite) stuffe
 d animal to the library for their very own sleepover! We’ll start the fe
 stivities by making your stuffie their own no-sew sock friend as they prep
 are to stay the night. Then leave your stuffies with us! They will be trea
 ted to a special night of activities and be ready to head home in the morn
 ing with pictures of all the fun they’ve had\, full of their adventures 
