 e project to build your new skills.\n\nDay 2: Learn how to read a sewing p
 attern\, properly prepare your fabric\, and begin assembling and adding de
 tails to your bag.\n\nDay 3: Put your bag together and complete a drawstr
 ing bag to take home.\n\n\nThis program is specifically designed for kids 
 ages 8+ that are able to work independently. No experience is needed. All 
 materials will be provided. Space is limited\, so be sure to sign up onlin
 e. \n\nThis is a series of three classes. Please register for all three s
 essions. Because each class builds on the previous one\, we ask that you r
 egister only if you are able to attend the entire series.\n\nAges: 6-11\, 
 12-18\nRegistration: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/even
 ts/6a41824541251a9e77c6d38d\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:31 PDT
