 heir caregivers can drop-in this hour explore sensory or building play! T
 his is an unstructured activity in a free-play environment\, and a chance 
 for small kids (ages 18 months to 3 years) to play with their grown-ups an
 d other kids. Come meet other caregivers\, and our staff will be on hand t
 o connect you to library resources. \n\nThis program is intended for chi
 ldren ages 18 months - 3. Adults must be accompanied by a child.\n\nAges: 
 0-5\nRegistration: none\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a0
 3611bf6bd012f00676f35\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:31 PDT
