BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[ATH] JAMaROO Kids Music & Movement
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260707T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260707T110000
DTSTAMP:20260703T223108Z
UID:smcl-69e2b03d1e64afd01e69ee4f@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Come clap your hands\, stomp your feet\, and shake your hips t
 o the rhythm and the beat! \n\nIn the JAMaROO Kids Music & Movement class
 es\, we’ll sing traditional songs and learn original ones too (many writ
 ten by our own teachers). Our music curriculum has been developed to spark
  creativity and incorporate imaginative play. Through movement activities\
 , children will build gross motor skills\, directly encouraging strength\,
  balance\, and coordination. Our teachers will use bean bags\, scarves\, s
 hakers\, rhythm sticks\, and other equipment to make classes more interact
 ive and hands-on. \n\nAt JAMaROO Kids all of our music\, dance\, and yoga
  curriculum is developed to support and foster all five key areas of devel
 opment: Cognitive\, Speech & Language\, Gross Motor Development\, Fine Mot
 or Development\, Social and Emotional.\n\n\nThis event will replace our re
 gular storytime. Join us afterwards for Stay & Play!\n\nAges: 0-5\nRegistr
 ation: none\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/69e2b03d1e64afd
 01e69ee4f\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:31 PDT
LOCATION:Atherton
URL:https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/69e2b03d1e64afd01e69ee4f
END:VEVENT
