UID:smcl-6a231d73c7d3cd58005e50e0@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun book club designed especially for tweens age
 s 9-12 who enjoy reading and discussing the story! \n\nIn the following m
 onths\, we’ll continue exploring books chosen by the group while talking
  about favorite characters\, exciting storylines\, and different perspecti
 ves. Each meeting features a lively discussion and will include a fun acti
 vity connected to the book.\n\nAges: 6-11\nRegistration: required\nSource:
