SUMMARY:[B] 3D Design CAD Class With Dry Ice Robotics
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260703T160000
DTSTAMP:20260703T223108Z
UID:smcl-6a271caa90cc4e3a790c8e11@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Dry Ice Robotics Team is coming to the Belmont library to teac
 h a series of classes on 3D Design. These hands-on classes will  show how 
 real engineers design\, build\, and solve problems.\n\nWhat students will 
 learn:\n\nFundamentals of computer-aided design (CAD).\n\nDesigning and bu
 ilding custom projects.\n\nDeveloping Problem-solving and spatial thinking
  skills.\n\nTurning ideas into digital designs ready for prototyping or 3D
  printing.\n\nComputers will be provided.\n\nAges: 6-11\, 12-18\nRegistrat
 ion: required\nSource: https://smcl.bibliocommons.com/events/6a271caa90cc4
 e3a790c8e11\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:31 PDT
