BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[SM] NorCal Bats!
DTSTART:20260721T003000Z
DTEND:20260721T013000Z
DTSTAMP:20260703T223108Z
UID:sanmateopl-LibCal-16089-16926744@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fascinating evening with NorCal Bats featuring l
 ive bat ambassadors! Discover the truth about local bats\, explore the myt
 hs and misconceptions surrounding these amazing animals\, and learn why ba
 ts play such an important role in our ecosystem. The program will conclude
  with time for audience questions and answers. All bats featured are certi
 fied non-releasable by the California Department of Fish & Wildlife and th
 e U.S. Department of Agriculture due to injuries that prevent them from su
 rviving in the wild.\n\nAges: unspecified\nSource: https://sanmateopublic.
 libcal.com/event/16926744\nLast synced: 2026-07-03 15:31 PDT
LOCATION:Oak Room
URL:https://sanmateopublic.libcal.com/event/16926744
END:VEVENT
